      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046440">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046442">AVX512_FP16</para>
      <para unique="1046443">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+264907"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046445">Complex multiply a pair of FP16 values from zmm2 and zmm3/m512/m32bcst, add to zmm1 and store the result in zmm1 subject to writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1046424">EVEX.128.F3.MAP6.W0 56 /r</para>
      <para unique="1046425">VFMADDCPH xmm1{k1}{z}, xmm2, xmm3/m128/m32bcst</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046427">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046429">V/V</para>
